+## APPENDED CORRECTION — 2026-09-09 (EXPR-COMPOSITION-2)
+
+**Nothing above this line has been altered.** A preregistration is not silently editable: §1–§7 are
+the text frozen at 2026-09-09T01:06:45Z, and the sha256
+`6386ac165562140e7bfeb1eb83944a2f17b3f057943c21d9b843b021041ec8ad` pinned in
+`composition_adjusted_contrast.py` refers to that frozen state. This appendix records, after the
+fact, two respects in which the frozen document does not match what the data or the run actually
+contained. It corrects the record; it revises no preregistered rule.
+
+### C1 · The §2 presence claim is FALSE on GPL3290
+
+§2 states that all 22 markers are readable "with per-sample `z_vs_array` for all 35 GPL6244 and all
+16 GPL3290 labelled samples". **On GPL6244 this holds (22/22 complete on all 35 samples). On
+GPL3290 it does not.** Re-derived independently twice — `../ASSESS-EXPR-COMPOSITION/checks/06`,
+`checks/07` and `../EXPR-COMPOSITION-2/checks/01` — the per-sample `z_vs_array` is missing as
+follows:
+
+| marker | GPL3290 samples missing (of 16) | of which in the EMC arm |
+|---|---|---|
+| DCN | 8 | 4 |
+| CD3E | 4 | 2 |
+| MS4A1 | 3 | 2 |
+| PTPRC | 2 | 2 |
+| CD8A | 1 | 0 |
+| HLA-DRA | 1 | 0 |
+| MKI67 (sensitivity covariate, not in `C`) | 1 | 1 |
+
+Because §2 defines `C` as a **NaN-skipping** mean, the consequence is that on GPL3290 `C` is not one
+fixed score but a mean over a **sample-dependent set of 16–20 of the 20 markers** (EMC arm mean
+19.00 markers, comparator arm 18.50), and the number of markers entering `C` itself correlates
+**+0.2105** with the EMC label. Fourteen of the 20 primary markers are complete on every labelled
+sample of both platforms; six — DCN, PTPRC, CD3E, CD8A, MS4A1, HLA-DRA — are not.
+
+For the record: a score built from only the 14 complete markers correlates **−0.4761** with the
+label on GPL3290 (published `C`: −0.5041) and **+0.9176** with published `C`. Its consequences for
+the headline are **not** small, and are recorded in `../EXPR-COMPOSITION-2/FINDING.md`.
+
+### C2 · Undisclosed deviation from a frozen permutation count
+
+§3 freezes `N_PERM_COMP = 2000` composition permutations for the negative control. **The published
+run used 500** (`composition_adjusted_contrast.py`, `N_PERM_COMP_NC = 500`; an earlier aborted run
+used 200). `FINDING.md` reports "500 permuted composition scores" but nowhere records that the
+frozen count was 2000. That is a **deviation from this preregistration and is recorded here as
+one**. It lowers the resolution of the negative control only; the seed (20260909) and `N_PERM =
+2000` for the adjusted label-permutation null were not changed.
